WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.430
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.700 --> 01:43.030
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.080 --> 01:43.720
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.880
[Episode 21]

5
01:56.350 --> 01:57.150
Li Si,

6
01:57.710 --> 01:58.430
is the one in front of you

7
01:58.430 --> 02:00.000
your master, Li San?

8
02:08.150 --> 02:10.240
Li Si has harbored a major criminal

9
02:10.240 --> 02:11.640
and colluded with Liluo.

10
02:12.240 --> 02:13.870
He is hereby stripped of his post as Divine Constable

11
02:13.870 --> 02:16.400
and shall receive the same sentence as the major criminal!

12
02:16.400 --> 02:17.190
Chief!

13
02:18.000 --> 02:18.860
Take him alive.

14
02:20.750 --> 02:21.180
Yes!

15
02:21.200 --> 02:21.710
Yes.

16
03:19.430 --> 03:21.680
The enemy who murdered your entire family

17
03:21.680 --> 03:22.910
is already dead.

18
03:23.240 --> 03:24.000
He's gotten

19
03:24.000 --> 03:25.600
the punishment he deserved.

20
03:25.800 --> 03:27.360
Give me the body.

21
03:27.470 --> 03:29.000
He raised me for many years.

22
03:30.360 --> 03:32.360
I will never let his remains

23
03:33.150 --> 03:34.710
be desecrated by others.

24
03:36.030 --> 03:37.000
Desecrated?

25
03:37.400 --> 03:38.490
My parents' bodies

26
03:38.510 --> 03:40.030
were left without burial for years.

27
03:40.030 --> 03:41.030
My younger brother, Shen Lan—

28
03:41.030 --> 03:41.840
to this day

29
03:41.870 --> 03:43.170
I don't even know where his body lies!

30
03:43.170 --> 03:43.930
And he

31
03:43.960 --> 03:46.000
gets to die and have it all end there?

32
04:11.030 --> 04:12.560
Your brother's body

33
04:13.560 --> 04:15.280
is now lying in the imperial mausoleum.

34
04:15.280 --> 04:16.560
He died...

35
04:18.390 --> 04:20.600
in place of a man named Zhou Yan.

36
04:20.600 --> 04:21.390
Zhou Yan?

37
04:23.040 --> 04:24.640
The Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan?

38
04:24.800 --> 04:25.800
How do you know?

39
04:26.040 --> 04:26.830
Meng Rui,

40
04:28.360 --> 04:29.070
if you think

41
04:29.100 --> 04:31.230
killing my master alone is not enough,

42
04:31.830 --> 04:33.600
kill me too.

43
04:34.040 --> 04:35.040
I only hope

44
04:35.560 --> 04:37.480
you won't spend the rest of your life

45
04:37.480 --> 04:39.240
consumed by hatred,

46
04:39.510 --> 04:40.240
and that you won't

47
04:40.240 --> 04:41.900
become someone like Tang Wei.

48
04:51.000 --> 04:52.390
Who are you, really?

49
04:57.870 --> 04:58.920
The Reaper Sword

50
05:00.430 --> 05:02.430
is the most sinister blade in the world.

51
05:02.430 --> 05:05.240
You've already been driven by hatred,

52
05:05.240 --> 05:06.430
and your sword heart has fallen into darkness.

53
05:06.430 --> 05:07.800
If you take it one step further,

54
05:07.800 --> 05:09.040
you will reach the Demon Sword realm— a state

55
05:09.040 --> 05:10.870
where all human attachments and emotions are severed.

56
05:10.870 --> 05:11.930
When that happens,

57
05:12.830 --> 05:14.600
you will lose your reason

58
05:15.000 --> 05:17.040
and become a murderous demon

59
05:17.190 --> 05:19.190
like your master, Dao Yin.

60
05:19.190 --> 05:20.160
Tell me,

61
05:20.630 --> 05:22.040
who are you really?

62
06:28.430 --> 06:29.430
Meng Rui, stop!

63
06:35.120 --> 06:35.920
Qingyang.

64
06:36.640 --> 06:37.560
Meng Rui.

65
06:40.159 --> 06:42.130
You stabbed me with your sword

66
06:42.600 --> 06:44.190
when we first met.

67
06:46.070 --> 06:46.870
Now,

68
06:49.430 --> 06:50.630
you've done it again.

69
07:27.400 --> 07:28.280
Li Qingyang!

70
07:28.310 --> 07:29.120
Li Qingyang!

71
07:29.120 --> 07:29.920
Qingyang!

72
07:31.310 --> 07:32.110
Qingyang!

73
07:38.190 --> 07:39.220
Qingyang!

74
07:58.560 --> 07:59.500
Li Si!

75
07:59.720 --> 08:00.650
Li Si!

76
08:01.240 --> 08:02.040
Li Si!

77
08:02.040 --> 08:02.800
Meng Rui!

78
08:03.510 --> 08:04.640
Li Si!

79
08:05.310 --> 08:06.800
Li Si!

80
08:06.830 --> 08:07.800
Meng Rui!

81
08:55.600 --> 08:56.460
Your Highness.

82
09:06.510 --> 09:07.520
My princess consort.

83
09:07.520 --> 09:09.920
[Ji Hongyi, Princess Ding]

84
09:10.360 --> 09:11.480
No.

85
09:12.840 --> 09:14.670
I'm no longer Prince Ding.

86
09:15.510 --> 09:16.910
Why are you still here?

87
09:17.830 --> 09:18.670
Go.

88
09:19.870 --> 09:20.730
Your Highness,

89
09:20.750 --> 09:22.870
my family was short-sighted and even went so far as

90
09:22.870 --> 09:24.320
to smuggle government salt,

91
09:24.320 --> 09:26.150
dragging Your Highness down with them.

92
09:26.150 --> 09:27.720
I can only atone

93
09:28.870 --> 09:30.000
with my death.

94
09:30.420 --> 09:33.560
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

95
09:42.480 --> 09:44.880
If I hadn't given the order and approved it,

96
09:45.150 --> 09:47.510
how could those relatives of yours in the countryside

97
09:47.510 --> 09:49.570
ever have had the nerve, or the means,

98
09:49.840 --> 09:51.030
to do such a thing?

99
09:57.650 --> 09:59.910
I deliberately kept it from you

100
10:00.550 --> 10:03.810
and put your family up to committing crimes.

101
10:10.720 --> 10:11.850
How could it be?

102
10:12.440 --> 10:13.720
How could it be you?

103
10:14.340 --> 10:14.450
You are just a fool!

104
10:14.450 --> 10:16.800
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

105
10:16.870 --> 10:19.350
You're just a lowly woman

106
10:20.150 --> 10:22.380
I picked up outside Tianhuang City

107
10:22.720 --> 10:25.080
17 years ago.

108
10:25.150 --> 10:27.320
You should've died

109
10:27.870 --> 10:29.080
back then!

110
10:30.030 --> 10:31.090
Listen carefully:

111
10:31.270 --> 10:33.030
I've never loved you.

112
10:33.840 --> 10:35.280
Get out!

113
10:43.730 --> 10:44.700
Your Highness,

114
10:44.870 --> 10:46.720
you kept this from me all along

115
10:47.080 --> 10:48.720
to protect me, right?

116
10:49.870 --> 10:51.260
Seventeen years ago,

117
10:53.080 --> 10:55.510
I was fortunate to have Your Highness take pity on me.

118
10:55.510 --> 10:56.910
For the rest of my life...

119
10:58.670 --> 10:59.930
I will never leave you.

120
11:02.080 --> 11:03.630
Stop talking.

121
11:03.630 --> 11:04.440
Leave.

122
11:07.080 --> 11:08.110
Get out!

123
11:40.750 --> 11:41.550
Who's there?

124
11:42.320 --> 11:44.720
The Princess Consort is deeply devoted to you,

125
11:44.720 --> 11:45.670
and you

126
11:45.670 --> 11:48.400
clearly care for her just as much, Your Highness.

127
11:49.080 --> 11:50.360
So why

128
11:51.080 --> 11:52.940
say such cruel things to hurt her?

129
11:54.550 --> 11:55.510
Lou Tianming?

130
11:55.960 --> 11:57.220
How did you get in here?

131
11:57.440 --> 11:58.670
It took some effort.

132
11:59.080 --> 12:00.390
I killed a guard

133
12:01.120 --> 12:02.780
and changed into his uniform.

134
12:03.480 --> 12:04.510
Even so,

135
12:04.840 --> 12:05.550
I could only make it

136
12:05.550 --> 12:07.750
as far as this side hall of the Cold Palace.

137
12:07.750 --> 12:09.680
The Yuque Palace in Tianhuang City

138
12:09.960 --> 12:11.600
is indeed heavily guarded.

139
12:12.720 --> 12:13.510
You've...

140
12:14.240 --> 12:15.320
come to kill me?

141
12:15.510 --> 12:16.870
Why would I kill you,

142
12:16.870 --> 12:18.030
a fallen prince

143
12:18.030 --> 12:19.630
stripped of his title?

144
12:20.670 --> 12:21.090
The Emperor may have stripped you

145
12:21.090 --> 12:21.550
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

146
12:21.550 --> 12:22.840
of your title,

147
12:23.360 --> 12:25.030
but once he passes away,

148
12:25.510 --> 12:26.510
someone must take

149
12:27.320 --> 12:29.030
the throne.

150
12:29.510 --> 12:30.910
When all is said and done,

151
12:31.240 --> 12:32.870
your only real rival

152
12:33.320 --> 12:34.790
is still the Crown Prince.

153
12:38.030 --> 12:39.060
Your Highness,

154
12:39.320 --> 12:41.000
why not cooperate with Liluo?

155
12:44.510 --> 12:45.840
How would we cooperate?

156
12:46.320 --> 12:48.050
Think about it, Your Highness.

157
12:48.150 --> 12:51.000
The Crown Prince is just a mediocrity.

158
12:51.510 --> 12:53.200
And who do you think

159
12:54.480 --> 12:56.610
secured his position as Crown Prince?

160
13:01.630 --> 13:02.440
Mother,

161
13:03.320 --> 13:05.440
you have wrinkles around your eyes now.

162
13:05.440 --> 13:06.510
Is it because I

163
13:06.730 --> 13:07.270
[Zhou Ye, Grand Heir Apparent]

164
13:07.270 --> 13:09.080
make you worry every day?

165
13:11.150 --> 13:12.510
As people grow older,

166
13:12.750 --> 13:14.350
wrinkles naturally appear.

167
13:15.960 --> 13:17.320
Come on, sit.

168
13:21.510 --> 13:22.720
If I never grew old,

169
13:22.870 --> 13:23.870
how could you

170
13:24.150 --> 13:25.600
ever grow up?

171
13:25.670 --> 13:27.720
Then I... won't grow up.

172
13:31.720 --> 13:32.790
By the way, Mother,

173
13:33.670 --> 13:36.320
I want to go visit Grandfather.

174
13:36.870 --> 13:37.910
I wonder

175
13:38.150 --> 13:39.630
if he's any better.

176
13:42.720 --> 13:44.650
Your Highness the Crown Princess.

177
13:47.030 --> 13:48.150
Your Highness the Crown Princess,

178
13:48.150 --> 13:50.810
it's time for His Highness to take his medicine.

179
13:54.480 --> 13:56.410
Your Highness the Crown Princess.

180
13:56.600 --> 13:57.390
Ye,

181
13:57.670 --> 13:59.510
be a good boy and finish your medicine first.

182
13:59.510 --> 14:00.720
Then get some good sleep.

183
14:00.720 --> 14:02.250
We'll talk when you wake up.

184
14:22.450 --> 14:24.080
The little Grand Heir Apparent, Zhou Ye,

185
14:24.080 --> 14:26.510
resembles the late Fourth Prince Zhou Yan quite closely,

186
14:26.510 --> 14:28.440
in both appearance

187
14:28.440 --> 14:29.720
and temperament.

188
14:32.840 --> 14:34.440
Zhou Yan, oh, Zhou Yan.

189
14:34.960 --> 14:35.960
My dear,

190
14:35.960 --> 14:37.510
lovable fourth brother.

191
14:38.870 --> 14:40.870
You've been dead for so many years,

192
14:41.750 --> 14:43.870
yet you still won't leave us in peace.

193
14:44.100 --> 14:44.480
[A Clear Heart and an Upright Nature]

194
14:44.480 --> 14:45.630
But what can

195
14:46.360 --> 14:47.870
a dead man possibly do?

196
14:50.030 --> 14:51.200
Whether in the past

197
14:52.440 --> 14:53.630
or now,

198
14:54.150 --> 14:56.720
when a man dies, his influence fades.

199
14:58.080 --> 15:00.510
Once the little Grand Heir Apparent is gone,

200
15:00.510 --> 15:01.510
what will that useless Zhou Tiao

201
15:01.510 --> 15:03.640
rely on to regain the Emperor's favor?

202
15:04.150 --> 15:06.080
However senile the Emperor may be,

203
15:06.240 --> 15:08.200
he'd still know whom to choose.

204
15:12.320 --> 15:14.570
There's no need for Your Highness to dirty your own hands.

205
15:14.570 --> 15:16.230
I'm willing to serve Your Highness

206
15:16.230 --> 15:17.480
with all my might.

207
15:19.870 --> 15:22.360
I only hope that once Your Highness ascends the throne,

208
15:22.360 --> 15:25.080
you will help me restore Liluo.

209
15:37.670 --> 15:38.790
I'm confined

210
15:39.080 --> 15:40.740
and cannot leave this palace.

211
15:40.870 --> 15:42.320
Only with this token

212
15:42.360 --> 15:44.790
can you mobilize my men.

213
15:53.630 --> 15:55.090
Thank you, Your Highness.

214
16:03.740 --> 16:06.980
[Winter's Haven]

215
16:17.470 --> 16:20.410
[Transcendent Mastery]

216
16:36.320 --> 16:37.080
Meng Rui.

217
16:58.360 --> 17:00.320
Come on, let's have a drink.

218
17:36.240 --> 17:37.640
You only get a few friends

219
17:38.310 --> 17:39.400
in a lifetime

220
17:40.510 --> 17:42.710
who'd go through hell and back with you.

221
17:42.720 --> 17:44.980
I know you have a feud with the demon-men.

222
17:45.350 --> 17:46.350
But you should've

223
17:46.720 --> 17:48.680
settled that with his master.

224
17:49.070 --> 17:51.400
What does that have to do with Li Qingyang?

225
17:51.880 --> 17:54.640
Do you really have to hate him so blindly

226
17:54.720 --> 17:56.520
that you sever all ties with him?

227
17:56.590 --> 17:57.510
Did

228
17:57.640 --> 17:59.770
the demon-men kill your whole family?

229
18:04.310 --> 18:05.110
Really?

230
18:08.350 --> 18:09.160
I...

231
18:09.920 --> 18:11.320
I didn't mean it that way.

232
18:16.480 --> 18:17.680
To tell you the truth,

233
18:17.880 --> 18:18.720
the Chief

234
18:19.720 --> 18:21.320
once suspected Li Qingyang.

235
18:21.920 --> 18:23.920
She even had me follow him secretly.

236
18:25.920 --> 18:26.790
Actually,

237
18:27.720 --> 18:29.320
I suspected him at first too.

238
18:30.720 --> 18:32.470
But that's the thing with that kid.

239
18:32.470 --> 18:34.200
He keeps everything bottled up

240
18:34.510 --> 18:36.000
and never tells us a thing.

241
18:36.750 --> 18:38.080
Suspicion is one thing,

242
18:38.550 --> 18:39.920
but if anyone dares claim that Qingyang

243
18:39.920 --> 18:41.480
is an accomplice of the demon-men

244
18:41.480 --> 18:42.940
or has harmed the country,

245
18:43.160 --> 18:45.160
I, Yan Cheng, will be the first to object.

246
18:45.160 --> 18:46.090
I believe in him.

247
18:46.440 --> 18:47.720
I'd stake my life on him.

248
18:47.720 --> 18:49.070
Just based on the fact that he risked his life to save you

249
18:49.070 --> 18:50.030
and Zhenzhu!

250
18:52.480 --> 18:53.720
He's my buddy.

251
18:54.510 --> 18:55.440
I believe in him.

252
19:11.110 --> 19:14.240
[Transcendent Mastery]

253
19:14.240 --> 19:15.030
Meng Rui!

254
19:20.930 --> 19:24.680
[Divine Constable Bureau]

255
19:56.750 --> 19:57.590
Li Si,

256
19:58.720 --> 19:59.790
I believe you're

257
19:59.790 --> 20:01.070
still alive.

258
20:02.480 --> 20:04.200
Wherever you may be,

259
20:05.960 --> 20:07.400
I only hope

260
20:08.240 --> 20:09.970
you will overcome every danger

261
20:10.880 --> 20:12.340
and remain safe and sound.

262
20:57.830 --> 20:59.070
My Lady.

263
21:07.510 --> 21:09.310
This subject wouldn't presume.

264
21:11.480 --> 21:12.310
Chief.

265
21:15.720 --> 21:17.720
Your Highness is of imperial blood.

266
21:18.110 --> 21:20.480
This subject wouldn't dare overstep.

267
21:39.350 --> 21:40.400
Xuanyuan Shan.

268
21:42.590 --> 21:46.520
This subject, Xuanyuan Shan, pays her respects to you, Fourth Prince.

269
21:46.920 --> 21:48.440
Long live Your Highness.

270
22:00.030 --> 22:00.880
Aunt.

271
22:04.550 --> 22:05.400
Yan.

272
22:17.200 --> 22:18.180
Aunt,

273
22:19.640 --> 22:21.750
how did you find out my true identity?

274
22:23.920 --> 22:26.650
You intentionally used the Spice-Refining Case

275
22:26.920 --> 22:28.640
to have Zhenzhu and the others find

276
22:28.640 --> 22:30.880
the puppet doll at the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

277
22:30.880 --> 22:31.680
All of that

278
22:32.430 --> 22:35.230
was so you could join the Divine Constable Bureau.

279
22:35.790 --> 22:36.550
After that,

280
22:37.640 --> 22:39.200
you tried every possible means

281
22:39.200 --> 22:41.000
to get into the Tianshu Pavilion

282
22:41.590 --> 22:44.510
to look through the case file on Shen Baoquan's family.

283
22:44.510 --> 22:45.880
From that moment on,

284
22:47.720 --> 22:49.200
I had my suspicions.

285
22:49.960 --> 22:50.790
Then...

286
22:52.160 --> 22:54.560
how did you find out Meng Rui's background?

287
22:55.350 --> 22:56.350
Even if

288
22:56.960 --> 22:58.480
you'd said nothing,

289
22:59.350 --> 23:01.150
I could've guessed a thing or two

290
23:01.790 --> 23:04.250
just from seeing him thrust his sword at you.

291
23:09.400 --> 23:11.530
If it weren't for his brother Shen Lan,

292
23:13.640 --> 23:15.550
how could I be alive today?

293
23:24.830 --> 23:25.920
I had thought that

294
23:27.750 --> 23:28.550
this time...

295
23:31.350 --> 23:33.410
I would just pay him back with my life.

296
23:34.790 --> 23:36.050
Who would have thought

297
23:36.590 --> 23:38.550
he would show me mercy?

298
23:43.160 --> 23:45.470
Calm down. Calm down.

299
23:47.160 --> 23:48.110
I've fed you the medicine

300
23:48.110 --> 23:49.270
Li San left behind.

301
23:55.310 --> 23:56.400
My master...

302
23:59.400 --> 24:00.720
He's been buried.

303
24:02.790 --> 24:04.920
For a Liluo heretic,

304
24:05.640 --> 24:08.100
that's already more mercy than he deserved.

305
24:08.160 --> 24:09.400
I only did it

306
24:09.520 --> 24:10.760
because he was

307
24:10.790 --> 24:11.880
your master.

308
24:13.750 --> 24:14.550
Precisely because

309
24:14.550 --> 24:16.200
Li San's identity was exposed,

310
24:16.200 --> 24:17.680
I became even more certain

311
24:18.270 --> 24:19.070
that you...

312
24:20.830 --> 24:21.960
are Yan.

313
24:25.550 --> 24:26.400
Back then,

314
24:26.960 --> 24:28.550
at the Mulan Hunting Ground,

315
24:28.550 --> 24:30.200
he was the one

316
24:30.200 --> 24:32.000
behind your kidnapping, right?

317
24:40.920 --> 24:41.720
Indeed.

318
24:43.550 --> 24:44.960
It was Li San

319
24:46.000 --> 24:47.200
who schemed to secretly

320
24:47.200 --> 24:48.270
abduct me.

321
24:50.000 --> 24:50.790
Later,

322
24:52.750 --> 24:54.070
he adopted me,

323
24:55.440 --> 24:56.720
raised me,

324
24:58.160 --> 24:59.400
taught me skills,

325
25:01.160 --> 25:03.360
and imparted all his martial arts to me.

326
25:05.240 --> 25:06.270
He did all that

327
25:07.640 --> 25:09.160
hoping that

328
25:09.750 --> 25:11.000
one day

329
25:11.830 --> 25:14.560
he could control the imperial court of Great Shi.

330
25:15.350 --> 25:16.160
But...

331
25:18.310 --> 25:19.640
the person who wanted to

332
25:21.550 --> 25:23.480
harm me at the Mulan Hunting Ground

333
25:24.720 --> 25:26.480
was not Li San.

334
25:29.310 --> 25:30.640
As for the real culprit,

335
25:31.310 --> 25:32.470
I think you,

336
25:33.400 --> 25:34.550
my father,

337
25:35.240 --> 25:37.170
and even the entire imperial court

338
25:38.000 --> 25:40.000
should all know very well who it was.

339
25:54.750 --> 25:55.550
Yan!

340
25:57.790 --> 25:58.590
Yan!

341
26:08.790 --> 26:09.920
I'll find a way

342
26:09.920 --> 26:11.320
to cure you of the poison.

343
26:14.200 --> 26:15.000
This poison

344
26:15.960 --> 26:17.290
can only be suppressed.

345
26:17.750 --> 26:18.960
There is no cure.

346
26:22.790 --> 26:23.640
Unless...

347
26:23.640 --> 26:24.640
Ode to Canglang.

348
26:26.510 --> 26:28.110
I searched the Tianshu Pavilion

349
26:28.110 --> 26:29.350
for a way to cure it.

350
26:30.110 --> 26:31.350
Whatever I found,

351
26:31.400 --> 26:32.200
I'm sure

352
26:32.750 --> 26:34.550
you've already looked through.

353
26:38.790 --> 26:44.390
[Heretical Tribe of Liluo]

354
26:53.860 --> 26:54.190
[Supplement to the History of Liluo]

355
26:54.580 --> 26:56.450
[Supplement to the History of Liluo; Scroll 7, Secret Record of the Five Wonders]

356
27:00.310 --> 27:02.440
There are 2 ways to cure the Chiying Bug Venom.

357
27:02.440 --> 27:03.200
The first

358
27:03.200 --> 27:04.750
is to fight poison with poison.

359
27:04.750 --> 27:06.590
When the larvae of the Chiying bugs die,

360
27:06.590 --> 27:07.830
they turn into a plant

361
27:07.830 --> 27:09.350
called Wangliang Grass.

362
27:09.400 --> 27:10.790
The juice extracted from it

363
27:10.790 --> 27:12.390
can suppress the bug poison.

364
27:12.790 --> 27:14.990
This method only suppresses the venom;

365
27:15.640 --> 27:17.030
it does not eradicate it.

366
27:17.030 --> 27:19.160
The medicine must be taken regularly,

367
27:19.160 --> 27:21.220
and its effect will eventually fade.

368
27:22.110 --> 27:24.170
Wangliang Grass is neutral in nature

369
27:24.310 --> 27:25.570
and pungent in flavor.

370
27:25.830 --> 27:26.600
Isn't that

371
27:26.630 --> 27:28.160
the medicine Li San gave me?

372
27:31.070 --> 27:31.880
The second

373
27:32.350 --> 27:34.030
is the Ode to Canglang,

374
27:34.400 --> 27:37.200
one of the Five Wonders of Liluo, which can cure it.

375
27:45.000 --> 27:46.930
Only the 3 words "Ode to Canglang."

376
27:48.000 --> 27:49.130
What does that mean?

377
27:58.200 --> 27:59.400
Even the Tianshu Pavilion

378
27:59.400 --> 28:01.060
has no record of how to cure it.

379
28:02.070 --> 28:03.130
Could it be that...

380
28:04.830 --> 28:06.680
I really don't have long to live?

381
28:07.310 --> 28:08.550
To cultivate the art,

382
28:08.640 --> 28:09.400
one must first

383
28:09.400 --> 28:12.480
see through the notions of self and other.

384
28:12.790 --> 28:13.750
And one must also have the good fortune

385
28:13.750 --> 28:15.400
to succeed without meaning to.

386
28:15.400 --> 28:16.440
In other words,

387
28:16.750 --> 28:19.720
the practitioner must keep cultivating, transcending illusion

388
28:19.720 --> 28:21.160
and relinquishing attachment, while remaining

389
28:21.160 --> 28:22.490
unknowing and unaware.

390
28:22.830 --> 28:23.640
Tell me,

391
28:24.160 --> 28:26.720
how many people in this world

392
28:27.000 --> 28:29.260
could ever reach such a state of no-self?

393
28:31.920 --> 28:32.720
Never mind.

394
28:33.590 --> 28:35.310
Life and death are decided by fate.

395
28:35.310 --> 28:36.310
Either way,

396
28:36.830 --> 28:37.920
I got

397
28:38.640 --> 28:40.880
17 extra years for free.

398
28:41.920 --> 28:43.050
I've come out ahead.

399
28:47.440 --> 28:48.440
By the way, Aunt.

400
28:50.920 --> 28:52.590
Speaking of the Tianshu Pavilion,

401
28:52.590 --> 28:54.440
there is one thing I still don't understand.

402
28:54.440 --> 28:55.240
Go ahead.

403
28:57.000 --> 28:58.510
Why is the mural of the six gods

404
28:58.510 --> 28:59.910
of the ancient Liluo Sect

405
29:00.200 --> 29:01.000
kept in the secret chamber

406
29:01.000 --> 29:02.800
of the Divine Constable Bureau?

407
29:04.000 --> 29:05.160
The late Emperor

408
29:05.720 --> 29:08.400
acquired that mural by chance during his conquest

409
29:08.400 --> 29:09.730
of the Kingdom of Liluo.

410
29:10.480 --> 29:11.270
Legend has it

411
29:11.400 --> 29:13.250
that the Holy Queen of Liluo, Qiangong Linglong,

412
29:13.250 --> 29:14.910
cast a curse before her death.

413
29:16.000 --> 29:18.130
She said that when the mural shatters,

414
29:18.590 --> 29:21.350
our Great Shi will fall with it.

415
29:22.920 --> 29:24.350
Perhaps the late Emperor

416
29:24.400 --> 29:26.130
was wary of the curse after all,

417
29:26.240 --> 29:28.030
so he ordered the mural

418
29:28.830 --> 29:31.510
sealed away in the deepest part of the Tianshu Pavilion

419
29:31.510 --> 29:33.170
and placed under heavy guard.

420
29:35.920 --> 29:37.030
I see.

421
29:37.510 --> 29:40.310
No wonder part of the mural had already fallen away

422
29:40.310 --> 29:42.770
when I entered the secret chamber last time.

423
29:43.200 --> 29:45.030
Qiangong Linglong's curse

424
29:45.830 --> 29:46.920
is coming true.

425
29:48.590 --> 29:49.790
What do you mean?

426
29:56.160 --> 29:57.880
I saw it with my own eyes.

427
29:58.790 --> 30:00.590
After the Moluo case was solved,

428
30:01.110 --> 30:03.350
the mural of Kelu, the God of Immortality,

429
30:03.350 --> 30:04.640
shattered on its own.

430
30:07.200 --> 30:09.330
After the black chest case was solved,

431
30:09.790 --> 30:12.790
the mural of Rangnan, the God of Prophecy, shattered.

432
30:14.640 --> 30:15.960
Next,

433
30:16.590 --> 30:19.450
after the government salt case in Mingling County,

434
30:20.110 --> 30:22.640
the mural of Qipi, the God of Lies, shattered.

435
30:23.400 --> 30:25.530
Then, after the Lanyue Pavilion case,

436
30:25.590 --> 30:27.650
Haiqu, the God of Hatred, shattered.

437
30:31.240 --> 30:33.510
Four of the six gods are gone.

438
30:34.160 --> 30:35.920
That leaves 2:

439
30:36.110 --> 30:38.590
Qiuyu, the God of Calamity,

440
30:39.750 --> 30:41.510
and Hanluo, the God of Death.

441
30:42.310 --> 30:43.160
Calamity...

442
30:44.310 --> 30:45.110
Death...

443
30:48.720 --> 30:50.270
What could they represent?

444
30:51.400 --> 30:53.130
I wonder what kind of bloodshed

445
30:53.590 --> 30:54.710
and upheaval

446
30:54.730 --> 30:56.590
our country will go through next.

447
31:32.300 --> 31:35.330
♪ Capture my heart ♪

448
31:35.930 --> 31:38.720
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

449
31:38.720 --> 31:40.230
So it actually has its own name:

450
31:40.230 --> 31:41.680
♪ Can we relive the mark you once carved deep? ♪

451
31:41.680 --> 31:42.090
"Severe-Cold."

452
31:42.090 --> 31:43.520
[Severe-Cold]

453
31:43.750 --> 31:45.510
What a good name.

454
31:45.640 --> 31:46.060
What was that technique you used

455
31:46.060 --> 31:47.590
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

456
31:47.590 --> 31:49.390
at the gate of Tianshu Pavilion?

457
31:49.590 --> 31:49.950
The Soaring Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation.

458
31:49.950 --> 31:51.920
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

459
31:51.920 --> 31:52.880
I'm a constable,

460
31:53.200 --> 31:54.180
and you're a suspect.

461
31:54.180 --> 31:54.830
♪ In a moment, I fell, a lifetime left to heal ♪

462
31:54.830 --> 31:56.160
You can explain it yourself back at the Bureau.

463
31:56.160 --> 31:57.000
Whether or not

464
31:57.000 --> 31:58.310
you consider me a friend,

465
31:58.310 --> 31:59.110
I

466
31:59.960 --> 32:00.580
will help you uncover the truth.

467
32:00.580 --> 32:03.550
♪ Tossing and turning through endless nights ♪

468
32:04.560 --> 32:07.460
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

469
32:08.590 --> 32:13.510
♪ Will we meet again, those I dare not face? ♪

470
32:13.510 --> 32:14.680
Since Dougu County,

471
32:14.680 --> 32:15.510
♪ One thought to ferry me across the sea of suffering ♪

472
32:15.510 --> 32:16.750
wouldn't you say

473
32:17.240 --> 32:17.810
we've been through thick and thin together?

474
32:17.810 --> 32:18.590
[Biyao Wine]

475
32:18.590 --> 32:21.490
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

476
32:22.690 --> 32:28.660
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough, till all turn to dust ♪

477
32:28.750 --> 32:28.930
The Reaper Sword

478
32:28.930 --> 32:31.270
♪ Dare not forget ♪

479
32:31.270 --> 32:32.760
is the most sinister blade in the world.

480
32:32.760 --> 32:33.510
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

481
32:33.510 --> 32:34.920
If you take it one step further,

482
32:34.920 --> 32:36.110
you will reach the Demon Sword realm— a state

483
32:36.110 --> 32:36.660
where all human attachments and emotions are severed.

484
32:36.660 --> 32:37.550
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

485
32:37.550 --> 32:38.610
When that happens,

486
32:39.400 --> 32:41.110
you will lose your reason

487
32:41.350 --> 32:43.480
and become a murderous demon

488
32:43.720 --> 32:43.960
like your master, Dao Yin.

489
32:43.960 --> 32:46.860
♪ Dare not think ♪

490
32:47.000 --> 32:49.960
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

491
32:50.970 --> 32:56.840
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

492
32:57.730 --> 33:00.680
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

493
33:01.150 --> 33:04.110
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

494
33:05.100 --> 33:11.690
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

495
33:13.120 --> 33:13.350
♪ Forever within your shadow by your side ♪

496
33:13.350 --> 33:14.350
Slow down.

497
33:14.920 --> 33:15.680
Be careful.

498
33:15.680 --> 33:16.550
I won't take it!

499
33:20.920 --> 33:22.000
-Your Majesty, please spare us. -Your Majesty, please spare us.

500
33:22.000 --> 33:23.550
-Your Majesty, please spare us. -Your Majesty, please spare us.

501
33:23.550 --> 33:25.000
Your Majesty, please spare us.

502
33:25.000 --> 33:26.200
Imperial Physician Sun,

503
33:26.200 --> 33:27.750
please find a way quickly.

504
33:27.750 --> 33:28.920
If His Majesty doesn't improve soon,

505
33:28.920 --> 33:29.680
neither of our heads

506
33:29.680 --> 33:31.110
will stay on our shoulders.

507
33:31.110 --> 33:32.720
I'll prepare the medicine at once,

508
33:32.720 --> 33:33.400
at once.

509
33:33.400 --> 33:34.350
Go, quickly.

510
33:34.590 --> 33:35.880
-Go. -Let's go.

511
33:38.830 --> 33:39.640
Eunuch Guo.

512
33:40.920 --> 33:43.240
Greetings, Your Highness.

513
33:43.720 --> 33:44.920
What's going on?

514
33:45.550 --> 33:46.610
Does Grandfather

515
33:46.640 --> 33:47.900
feel any better today?

516
33:51.880 --> 33:52.590
Grandfather!

517
33:52.590 --> 33:55.000
-Your Highness, please listen to me. -Your Highness.

518
33:55.000 --> 33:56.960
His Majesty has specifically ordered

519
33:56.960 --> 33:58.680
that he will see no one today.

520
33:59.070 --> 34:01.720
Your Highness, please go back for now.

521
34:01.740 --> 34:04.030
But I want to check on Grandfather.

522
34:04.110 --> 34:07.110
Please don't make it difficult for me, Your Highness.

523
34:08.199 --> 34:09.010
How about

524
34:09.480 --> 34:10.440
we just

525
34:10.760 --> 34:12.190
head back for today?

526
34:12.280 --> 34:13.070
Look.

527
34:14.000 --> 34:14.860
Your Highness,

528
34:15.480 --> 34:16.840
the wind is so strong today.

529
34:16.840 --> 34:18.270
If anything were to happen to you,

530
34:18.270 --> 34:19.040
neither of us

531
34:19.480 --> 34:21.280
could bear the responsibility.

532
34:23.190 --> 34:24.000
Ye!

533
34:25.320 --> 34:26.070
Mother.

534
34:26.070 --> 34:27.280
Ye, come here.

535
34:30.290 --> 34:31.090
Mother.

536
34:31.320 --> 34:32.380
Give me your hands.

537
34:33.070 --> 34:33.880
Are you cold?

538
34:34.860 --> 34:35.380
No.

539
34:35.409 --> 34:37.489
You've come to see your grandfather again?

540
34:37.489 --> 34:40.090
Greetings, Your Highness the Crown Princess.

541
34:40.510 --> 34:41.370
Your Highness,

542
34:41.469 --> 34:42.580
if there's nothing else,

543
34:42.580 --> 34:44.380
I'll go attend to His Majesty.

544
34:51.920 --> 34:53.570
I'm sure Eunuch Guo will convey

545
34:53.570 --> 34:56.280
your filial devotion to your grandfather.

546
34:56.590 --> 34:58.400
Instead of worrying here,

547
34:58.510 --> 35:00.300
why don't you come back with me?

548
35:00.360 --> 35:01.670
You and I

549
35:01.670 --> 35:03.200
can go to the Buddhist hall together

550
35:03.200 --> 35:04.610
and pray for your grandfather.

551
35:04.610 --> 35:05.470
How about that?

552
35:08.030 --> 35:08.840
Mother,

553
35:09.110 --> 35:10.920
I want to go to the Golden Dragon Pavilion

554
35:10.920 --> 35:13.780
to seek the Dragon Saliva Crystal for Grandfather.

555
35:18.670 --> 35:19.480
Ye,

556
35:20.190 --> 35:23.550
I understand how you feel.

557
35:24.920 --> 35:25.760
They say

558
35:26.080 --> 35:28.510
the Dragon Saliva Crystal of the Golden Dragon Pavilion

559
35:28.510 --> 35:31.710
can cure all diseases and even bring the dead back to life.

560
35:31.710 --> 35:33.270
But across the country,

561
35:33.290 --> 35:36.100
who has ever actually seen or used it?

562
35:36.880 --> 35:37.980
If you ask me,

563
35:38.070 --> 35:40.510
it's just a legend.

564
35:40.590 --> 35:41.920
Even if you go,

565
35:41.920 --> 35:43.920
you'll only return empty-handed.

566
35:44.360 --> 35:45.280
Besides,

567
35:45.590 --> 35:46.880
you've never left

568
35:46.920 --> 35:48.880
this palace in your entire life.

569
35:49.150 --> 35:50.590
How could I

570
35:50.620 --> 35:52.420
rest easy knowing you're going?

571
35:52.480 --> 35:54.280
Mother, don't worry.

572
35:54.670 --> 35:55.700
I'll have imperial guards

573
35:55.700 --> 35:57.300
protecting me at all times.

574
35:57.550 --> 35:59.110
As for the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

575
35:59.110 --> 36:00.620
whether it exists or not,

576
36:00.710 --> 36:02.890
I must at least try.

577
36:03.110 --> 36:04.150
As the saying goes,

578
36:04.150 --> 36:06.670
"Unlock Heaven's mysteries, and the Way shall be attained;

579
36:06.670 --> 36:08.280
a hundred-foot golden dragon guards the crystal."

580
36:08.280 --> 36:09.040
The Golden Dragon Pavilion

581
36:09.040 --> 36:10.960
is the closest place on earth to the heavens.

582
36:10.960 --> 36:12.290
The late Emperor went there,

583
36:12.290 --> 36:13.940
and so did Grandfather.

584
36:14.550 --> 36:15.550
I believe that

585
36:15.710 --> 36:17.320
as long as I pray sincerely,

586
36:17.550 --> 36:19.280
the Golden Dragon King will surely manifest

587
36:19.280 --> 36:20.210
and

588
36:20.240 --> 36:22.640
bless Grandfather with a speedy recovery.

589
36:42.030 --> 36:46.300
[The Resurrected Shadow Puppeteer Murder Case]

590
36:49.750 --> 36:54.440
[Gutan County, Tianyuan Prefecture, Jinzhou, Great Shi Dynasty]

591
36:55.230 --> 36:57.460
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

592
37:17.690 --> 37:18.800
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

593
37:18.800 --> 37:19.340
Out of the way, all of you!

594
37:19.340 --> 37:19.710
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

595
37:19.710 --> 37:20.590
What are you wandering around for?

596
37:20.590 --> 37:21.520
You there, halt!

597
37:21.640 --> 37:22.450
Get lost!

598
37:22.480 --> 37:23.880
What are you loitering for?

599
37:23.880 --> 37:24.480
Stop! Come here!

600
37:24.480 --> 37:25.110
What are you doing here?

601
37:25.110 --> 37:25.510
Officer,

602
37:25.510 --> 37:26.580
I'm from the coffin shop at the west end of the street...

603
37:26.580 --> 37:27.360
Get out of sight now!

604
37:27.360 --> 37:28.310
Don't come out without good reason!

605
37:28.310 --> 37:29.110
How unlucky!

606
37:29.150 --> 37:29.960
Let's go!

607
37:35.280 --> 37:36.550
Isn't it just the Grand Heir Apparent?

608
37:36.550 --> 37:37.980
So what if he comes?

609
37:38.190 --> 37:38.960
Look,

610
37:38.960 --> 37:39.960
they've been making

611
37:39.960 --> 37:41.280
such a big fuss in the streets lately

612
37:41.280 --> 37:42.940
that nobody can live in peace.

613
37:43.070 --> 37:44.960
A couple of days ago, they even stopped me

614
37:44.960 --> 37:46.070
and demanded to see my travel permit.

615
37:46.070 --> 37:46.760
Do they

616
37:46.760 --> 37:49.160
really need to inspect us this thoroughly?

617
37:49.550 --> 37:50.880
Well, I wouldn't say that.

618
37:50.880 --> 37:52.070
Haven't you heard?

619
37:52.280 --> 37:53.800
Just a few days ago,

620
37:53.960 --> 37:56.450
the shadow puppet ghost killed again.

621
37:56.880 --> 37:57.920
Four bodies

622
37:57.920 --> 37:59.550
were found on Mount Hanhao.

623
37:59.550 --> 38:00.400
Two men and two women,

624
38:00.400 --> 38:01.920
covered in blood.

625
38:02.400 --> 38:03.320
So it really happened?

626
38:03.320 --> 38:04.550
-Yeah. -It's so terrifying.

627
38:04.550 --> 38:05.920
The 3 of us are from out of town.

628
38:05.920 --> 38:07.110
Aren't you a local?

629
38:07.110 --> 38:07.800
Tell us about it.

630
38:07.800 --> 38:08.550
Yeah.

631
38:10.510 --> 38:12.310
You've come to the right person.

632
38:12.320 --> 38:13.920
Not only am I a local,

633
38:14.210 --> 38:15.940
but I'm also from Yin Village.

634
38:15.970 --> 38:16.510
Really?

635
38:16.510 --> 38:17.800
Alright, stop teasing us.

636
38:17.800 --> 38:18.760
Get on with it.

637
38:18.760 --> 38:19.480
Here.

638
38:19.880 --> 38:21.150
Our Gutan County

639
38:21.150 --> 38:23.670
is famous for 2 things.

640
38:23.800 --> 38:26.070
Do you know what they are?

641
38:26.110 --> 38:27.390
Who doesn't?

642
38:27.410 --> 38:29.400
One is the osmanthus wine served in glass goblets,

643
38:29.400 --> 38:30.030
and the other is

644
38:30.030 --> 38:32.400
the enchanting shadow puppet show.

645
38:32.400 --> 38:33.200
That's right.

646
38:33.400 --> 38:34.860
And this strange incident

647
38:35.590 --> 38:36.880
began with

648
38:37.070 --> 38:40.000
the enchanting shadow puppet show.

649
38:40.000 --> 38:41.280
Six years ago...

650
38:41.360 --> 38:44.630
♪ Tears streamed down her cheeks ♪

651
38:44.840 --> 38:46.960
♪ The Milky Way stretched clear and shallow ♪

652
38:46.960 --> 38:48.280
[Yin Jie, Shadow Puppeteer]

653
38:48.280 --> 38:49.770
♪ How far apart could the two shores be? ♪

654
38:49.770 --> 38:52.420
[Yin Jie's Wife]

655
39:00.800 --> 39:02.840
Come on. Get some rest.

656
39:06.590 --> 39:09.320
Hong, slow down.

657
39:13.510 --> 39:14.590
This slope is harder to climb than I thought.

658
39:14.590 --> 39:15.360
Are you tired?

659
39:15.360 --> 39:16.070
Not at all.

660
39:16.440 --> 39:18.000
I'll go play with him for a while.

661
39:18.000 --> 39:19.840
Hong! Come here.

662
39:21.440 --> 39:22.230
That's him.

663
39:27.590 --> 39:29.440
Here, have a bite.

664
39:31.190 --> 39:32.030
Is it good?

665
39:33.760 --> 39:35.780
Then let's have another bite, okay?

666
39:38.280 --> 39:39.070
Come on.

667
39:43.880 --> 39:45.140
Papa is back.

668
39:47.880 --> 39:48.670
Coming.

669
39:52.960 --> 39:54.590
Mama!

670
40:05.360 --> 40:06.440
Who are you?

671
40:06.550 --> 40:07.700
Let go of me!

672
40:08.280 --> 40:09.280
Let go of me!

673
40:09.400 --> 40:10.400
Let go!

674
40:14.510 --> 40:16.000
Mama!

675
40:28.510 --> 40:33.670
Flat hands, flat feet, a body flat as can be.

676
40:34.510 --> 40:39.070
Yet it claims to be human, not a shadow.

677
40:40.150 --> 40:44.710
Is it a puppet performing shadow play,

678
40:45.360 --> 40:50.920
or a shadow puppet wearing human skin?

679
40:52.960 --> 40:54.070
And then what happened?

680
40:54.070 --> 40:55.590
Then Yin Jie was arrested by the county government?

681
40:55.590 --> 40:56.880
-Yeah. -I heard

682
40:56.960 --> 40:59.000
that he was later cornered in the Golden Dragon Pavilion

683
40:59.000 --> 41:00.600
by the county constables.

684
41:00.620 --> 41:01.920
And guess what?

685
41:01.920 --> 41:03.360
The Dragon King manifested

686
41:03.360 --> 41:04.590
and ate him.

687
41:04.590 --> 41:05.440
Ate him?

688
41:05.510 --> 41:06.760
How could the Dragon King have eaten him?

689
41:06.760 --> 41:08.510
Since Yin Jie is dead,

690
41:08.670 --> 41:10.360
this latest incident at Mount Hanhao

691
41:10.360 --> 41:11.710
can't have been his doing, right?

692
41:11.710 --> 41:13.320
That's what makes it so eerie.

693
41:13.320 --> 41:14.510
All 4 victims

694
41:14.510 --> 41:16.110
had been bound hand and foot

695
41:16.360 --> 41:17.510
and hung from trees

696
41:17.510 --> 41:18.510
like shadow puppets.

697
41:18.510 --> 41:20.260
It was exactly the same as

698
41:20.290 --> 41:21.630
what happened 6 years ago.

699
41:21.630 --> 41:22.600
Think about it.

700
41:22.710 --> 41:23.630
Who else could have done

701
41:23.630 --> 41:24.550
something like this

702
41:24.550 --> 41:26.260
besides that madman?

703
41:26.560 --> 41:28.110
Everyone in the village says

704
41:28.110 --> 41:30.000
it's Yin Jie's spirit

705
41:30.110 --> 41:31.510
coming back for revenge.

706
41:31.630 --> 41:32.840
They say that once he collects

707
41:32.840 --> 41:34.550
81 sets of hearts and livers,

708
41:34.630 --> 41:37.570
his wife and son will be brought back to life.

709
41:38.320 --> 41:39.950
Freshly steamed buns!

710
41:40.030 --> 41:42.090
Generous filling and thin wrappers!

711
41:51.840 --> 41:52.470
[Steamed Bun Shop]

712
42:22.150 --> 42:23.670
Quick, move it.

713
42:23.760 --> 42:25.150
Quick, all of you, go help!

714
42:25.150 --> 42:27.070
Go help! Why are you just standing there?

715
42:27.070 --> 42:28.550
Hurry up! Tell them to hurry!

716
42:28.550 --> 42:29.480
Hurry up.

717
42:31.940 --> 42:32.150
[Du Zhongtao, Magistrate of Gutan County]

718
42:32.150 --> 42:32.960
My Lord,

719
42:33.280 --> 42:34.760
fortunately, we discovered them in time,

720
42:34.760 --> 42:36.400
and there were few pedestrians here.

721
42:36.400 --> 42:37.190
Otherwise,

722
42:37.190 --> 42:37.920
who knows

723
42:37.940 --> 42:39.940
how many people would've seen them.

724
42:40.550 --> 42:42.380
Nothing stays hidden forever.

725
42:43.000 --> 42:44.200
This time, we must make absolutely sure

726
42:44.200 --> 42:45.600
the news doesn't get out.

727
42:46.070 --> 42:48.030
Let's wait until the blessing ceremony is over.

728
42:48.030 --> 42:48.840
Yes.

729
42:57.320 --> 42:58.280
My Lord,

730
42:58.920 --> 43:01.070
should we bury these bodies too?

731
43:01.070 --> 43:01.910
Bury them at once.

732
43:01.910 --> 43:03.110
Don't waste a moment.

733
43:03.760 --> 43:04.620
You must find

734
43:04.650 --> 43:05.650
a secluded place.

735
43:05.880 --> 43:08.080
Make absolutely sure no one discovers them.

736
43:08.080 --> 43:08.920
Yes.

737
43:14.360 --> 43:15.510
Heavens above,

738
43:17.550 --> 43:18.420
please rid us of

739
43:18.450 --> 43:20.160
this vengeful spirit.

740
43:20.400 --> 43:22.800
Otherwise, my days as Magistrate of Gutan County

741
43:22.800 --> 43:24.590
may well be numbered.

742
43:24.780 --> 43:25.190
[Shangfang Drum] [Divine Constable Bureau]

743
43:25.190 --> 43:26.320
Set out immediately

744
43:26.360 --> 43:27.480
and ride at full speed.

745
43:27.480 --> 43:29.760
You must arrive before the blessing procession,

746
43:29.760 --> 43:31.760
find out what's really going on in Gutan County,

747
43:31.760 --> 43:33.480
and clear all potential obstacles.

748
43:33.480 --> 43:34.960
It concerns the safety of the Grand Heir Apparent.

749
43:34.960 --> 43:36.190
You must be extremely careful.

750
43:36.190 --> 43:38.450
There must be no negligence whatsoever.

751
43:39.070 --> 43:39.880
Yes,

752
43:40.070 --> 43:41.190
Chief!

753
43:42.280 --> 43:43.590
Take good care of Lord Meng.

754
43:43.590 --> 43:45.650
We leave the Bureau's affairs to you.

755
43:50.580 --> 43:50.760
[Chief Constable's Hall]

756
43:50.760 --> 43:51.920
Looks like the Chief

757
43:51.920 --> 43:53.330
doesn't want Meng to go this time.

758
43:53.330 --> 43:55.150
He hasn't left Winter's Haven for 3 months.

759
43:55.150 --> 43:56.150
The whole thing with Qingyang

760
43:56.150 --> 43:57.480
hit him too hard.

761
43:58.320 --> 43:59.240
This time,

762
43:59.360 --> 44:00.360
it's on you and me.

763
44:00.450 --> 44:01.220
With me around,

764
44:01.220 --> 44:02.220
you've got nothing to worry about.
